sequenceDiagram
    participant CallCtrl as Call Controller
    participant Rec as Recording Service
    participant RecRepo as Recording Repository
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant S3 as MinIO/S3

    CallCtrl->>Rec: startRecording(callId)
    Rec-->>CallCtrl: recordingId

    Note over Rec: Stream chunks to object storage
    loop every chunk
        Rec->>S3: PUT /recordings/{id}/chunkN
    end

    Rec->>MediaRepo: save media record (URI, duration, codec)
    MediaRepo->>PG: INSERT media
    Rec->>RecRepo: finalize recording (status=READY)
    RecRepo->>PG: UPDATE recordings
    Rec-->>CallCtrl: READY + mediaUri
